'''Achievements''' are goals set by the game that players can try to reach to earn [[experience]] points, [[decorations]], and [[diamond]]s. There are a total of 50 different types achievements, each able to be completed to the 3rd level, making 150 total achievements. It was introduced in Update 0.4 exclusively for Canada, although when the global version was released, it introduced all the content in previous updates for Canada.

Achievements are unlocked at [[experience]] level 6 and can be viewed via the [[farmhouse]], whose appearance changes as one gets more achievements.
